    ///
    /// [`Entry`]: ../struct.Entry.html
    /// [`and_compute_with`]: #method.and_compute_with
    /// [`and_try_compute_with`]: #method.and_try_compute_with
    ///
    /// # Example
    ///
    /// ```rust
